faqs:
  - q: Is this a ticket queue or a retainer?
    a: Retainer. A dedicated pod with a named lead. We work inside your ITSM tool of choice but the service is not measured in tickets closed.
  - q: What about hypercare after go-live?
    a: Yes. Hypercare typically runs 4 to 8 weeks post-go-live. It can continue into a long-term managed arrangement or hand off to your team.
  - q: Do you handle Salesforce admin-only work?
    a: Yes. Smaller orgs sometimes only need admin coverage. We scope that separately at a lower monthly cost.
  - q: Can you cover both Salesforce and SAP?
    a: Yes. One team with practitioners on both sides. Integration problems stop being finger-pointing exercises.
  - q: What if we want to modernize underneath support?
    a: The managed arrangement can run alongside a project engagement. Often the project team and support pod share leadership to keep context.
